 "headline": [
  "On nobond_vt08, one sheet filled one open late is worth -932 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 417 sheets, p10..p90 -10,320..5,939); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -12.1 bps with t=-4.57. The 417 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 1e-03 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 1.88pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it.",
  "On nobond_base, one sheet filled one open late is worth -1,450 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 417 sheets, p10..p90 -20,591..11,342); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -18.9 bps with t=-4.28. The 417 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 2e-03 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 3.69pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it."
